WEBVTT

00:00:10.611 --> 00:00:15.149
My right hand
holds a bowl of gold,

00:00:15.149 --> 00:00:19.954
And my left holds
one of silver.

00:00:19.954 --> 00:00:24.091
Never one
without the other,

00:00:24.158 --> 00:00:37.238
Two unseen bowls
for each of us.

00:00:37.238 --> 00:00:45.646
The golden one
is filled with joy,

00:00:45.713 --> 00:00:53.054
shining warmly.

00:00:53.054 --> 00:00:57.792
Since we met,
my golden bowl

00:00:57.859 --> 00:01:04.732
cannot hold all my
happiness and love.

00:01:06.534 --> 00:01:14.943
Golden joy, silver sadness,

00:01:14.943 --> 00:01:22.217
I would leave
my past behind...

00:01:22.217 --> 00:01:27.022
For you, for the
sake of love,

00:01:27.022 --> 00:01:33.962
I would empty the
bowls of my past.

00:01:35.630 --> 00:01:41.636
Based on the manga by the beloved
Ikeda Riyoko

00:01:52.046 --> 00:01:54.448
There you are, Misonoo-san!

00:01:55.516 --> 00:01:57.118
Why on earth are you HERE?

00:01:57.118 --> 00:01:58.386
Hurry! Hurry!

00:01:58.386 --> 00:02:02.056
Why? What happened?

00:02:06.394 --> 00:02:11.866
4. The Music Box.

00:02:15.670 --> 00:02:17.872
You are rather late.

00:02:18.272 --> 00:02:21.209
I told you the party starts at noon.

00:02:22.010 --> 00:02:22.744
Yes...
<b> </b>
<b> </b>

00:02:22.744 --> 00:02:23.945
Yes...
No...
<b> </b>

00:02:23.945 --> 00:02:24.880
Yes...
No...
I mean...

00:02:24.946 --> 00:02:26.013
All right...

00:02:26.013 --> 00:02:27.882
Please be seated, Misonoo-san.

00:02:28.883 --> 00:02:29.817
Ok.

00:02:33.755 --> 00:02:38.760
But Miya-sama called yesterday
- So why would...

00:02:40.562 --> 00:02:43.431
I will ask you a few questions.

00:02:43.832 --> 00:02:44.700
Yes.

00:02:44.700 --> 00:02:49.237
What are your hobbies?
And what club will you join?

00:02:49.838 --> 00:02:51.906
Sure! My hobbies...

00:02:53.374 --> 00:02:54.843
I like baking!

00:03:00.181 --> 00:03:03.785
But... I haven't decided
which club to join...

00:03:04.252 --> 00:03:06.588
I belong to the Flower Arranging
Club and the Riding Club.

00:03:07.522 --> 00:03:08.723
Flower Arranging...?

00:03:11.059 --> 00:03:13.995
I... I will join the Flower
Arranging Club also!

00:03:17.198 --> 00:03:20.402
She smiled!
Miya-sama smiled...

00:03:21.203 --> 00:03:23.004
Who is your favorite author?

00:03:23.538 --> 00:03:26.741
Good! She may not
be upset anymore.

00:03:27.742 --> 00:03:32.481
Saint-Ex-Upery who wrote "The
Little Prince" and Montgomery
of "Ann of Green Gables"!

00:03:33.215 --> 00:03:34.950
"The Little Prince"?
<b> </b>
<b> </b>

00:03:34.950 --> 00:03:36.218
"The Little Prince"?
And "Ann"?
<b> </b>

00:03:36.218 --> 00:03:38.019
"The Little Prince"?
And "Ann"?
Like a little kid!

00:03:38.353 --> 00:03:43.759
Oh no, they thought it was too childish!
Well, let's see, umm...

00:03:44.092 --> 00:03:46.228
De Sade! I also like De Sade!

00:03:46.294 --> 00:03:48.230
The Marquis de Sade?
<b> </b>

00:03:48.230 --> 00:03:49.765
The Marquis de Sade?
Of sadism and masochism?

00:03:50.299 --> 00:03:53.835
Wonderful! Which
one do you prefer?

00:03:54.303 --> 00:03:56.572
Ummm... Ummm...

00:03:56.572 --> 00:03:57.372
Say sadism!
<b> </b>

00:03:57.372 --> 00:03:58.373
Say sadism!
She's perverted!

00:03:58.373 --> 00:03:58.707
Say sadism!
She's perverted! Sadism!

00:03:58.707 --> 00:04:00.642
Say sadism!
She's perverted! Sadism! Weird!

00:04:01.510 --> 00:04:04.379
That's fine. She is liberal...

00:04:10.853 --> 00:04:13.188
That's all, Misonoo-san.

00:04:15.524 --> 00:04:19.261
The results will be
announced tomorrow.

00:04:22.531 --> 00:04:25.467
Failed. I have failed.

00:04:25.868 --> 00:04:27.736
It's not final yet.

00:04:27.937 --> 00:04:32.341
No... I'm sure. I couldn't
even answer the questions.

00:04:33.208 --> 00:04:35.745
That's not important
at all! You did fine.

00:04:35.745 --> 00:04:39.882
But... but it wasn't
good that you were late.

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:46.155
What happened? I told you that
being on time was so important!

00:04:48.691 --> 00:04:52.695
But... yesterday
Miya-sama called...

00:04:52.695 --> 00:04:55.965
She said that the party
would start at three instead.

00:04:58.034 --> 00:05:04.707
I don't understand.
Why would she do that?

00:05:05.641 --> 00:05:06.976
My mother answered...

00:05:09.045 --> 00:05:11.714
It could have been anyone!

00:05:12.381 --> 00:05:13.649
It's her!

00:05:13.649 --> 00:05:15.785
Only she could do such a thing!

00:05:17.253 --> 00:05:19.255
Misaki Aya...

00:05:35.204 --> 00:05:37.741
After that...

00:05:37.741 --> 00:05:40.076
How did I get home...

00:05:40.076 --> 00:05:42.011
I don't remember.

00:05:42.679 --> 00:05:46.950
It could have been a
Sunday like any other,

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:50.620
Spent baking a
cake with Tomoko...

00:05:51.955 --> 00:05:55.492
My brother... can this
really be happening?

00:05:56.826 --> 00:06:00.830
A fake phone call... I can't
comprehend such deception.

00:06:02.766 --> 00:06:06.569
If it's really true,
it's simply awful.

00:06:06.970 --> 00:06:12.108
But... even worse, if I
were in such a situation...

00:06:14.177 --> 00:06:19.449
Could I be sure that I
would not do the same...

00:06:25.989 --> 00:06:29.793
Nanako, it's Tomoko.
She's at the corner.

00:06:34.131 --> 00:06:36.800
I figured you might
be back already...

00:06:40.337 --> 00:06:44.608
A fake phone call?
What a cheat she is!

00:06:44.875 --> 00:06:49.413
There's no way to be sure, but
Shinobu-san thinks it was her.

00:06:51.682 --> 00:06:54.751
I understand how you feel.

00:06:58.889 --> 00:07:02.092
Being admitted into the Sorority
is a fabulous experience.

00:07:02.359 --> 00:07:04.628
Something that any
girl would want.

00:07:05.162 --> 00:07:06.897
Even I...

00:07:07.431 --> 00:07:08.699
Tomoko...

00:07:09.433 --> 00:07:13.504
But I always knew I hadn't
the slightest chance.

00:07:14.238 --> 00:07:17.975
I couldn't believe I
could be chosen either.

00:07:19.376 --> 00:07:20.844
True...

00:07:21.645 --> 00:07:24.114
That's... that's true!

00:07:24.448 --> 00:07:28.719
Now I don't have to worry about
being slandered by anybody.

00:07:33.057 --> 00:07:34.658
I feel much better.

00:07:34.658 --> 00:07:36.193
What a relief!

00:07:38.395 --> 00:07:43.534
We've been playing on
these swings for so long...

00:07:43.534 --> 00:07:44.535
Uh-huh!

00:07:51.142 --> 00:07:53.144
We will be friends forever, OK?

00:07:53.144 --> 00:07:54.145
Sure!

00:07:56.213 --> 00:07:58.549
So anyway! Tomoko! The clubs!

00:07:58.549 --> 00:08:00.418
So which will you join?

00:08:00.418 --> 00:08:01.819
The Cooking Club, of course!

00:08:01.819 --> 00:08:03.554
Then I'll join too!

00:08:03.554 --> 00:08:05.489
I wasn't sure about the
Flower Arranging Club...

00:08:05.489 --> 00:08:10.494
I'll get you an application
form tomorrow!

00:08:10.828 --> 00:08:12.229
Yes, please!

00:08:29.580 --> 00:08:31.048
Oh, good morning, Shinobu-san!

00:08:33.718 --> 00:08:34.786
What's that all about?
<b> </b>

00:08:34.786 --> 00:08:36.721
What's that all about?
It's about "Passed"! And "Chosen"!

00:08:36.721 --> 00:08:37.588
What?
<b> </b>

00:08:37.588 --> 00:08:40.324
What?
As in "membership"!

00:08:41.526 --> 00:08:42.727
Congratulations...

00:08:42.927 --> 00:08:45.930
Yes, and the same to you!

00:08:48.399 --> 00:08:51.202
You mean you haven't
seen the announcement?

00:08:51.269 --> 00:08:53.338
Let's go! Come on!

00:08:59.744 --> 00:09:02.147
Yes! It's amazing!

00:09:02.147 --> 00:09:05.083
There were nineteen candidates.

00:09:05.083 --> 00:09:09.087
Every one them is
superior to Misonoo-san.

00:09:10.221 --> 00:09:12.957
You miserable potato heads!

00:09:12.957 --> 00:09:14.225
What!

00:09:14.426 --> 00:09:16.361
Want me to say it again?

00:09:16.828 --> 00:09:18.430
Potato heads!

00:09:18.430 --> 00:09:20.832
It's still true what I said!

00:09:22.901 --> 00:09:26.571
Go away! This is none
of your business!

00:09:27.105 --> 00:09:29.441
I'll not forget this!

00:09:29.441 --> 00:09:31.109
I'll protest directly to Miya-sama!

00:09:32.444 --> 00:09:36.181
You didn't even attend the party!

00:09:38.383 --> 00:09:41.319
Aha! How is it YOU know that?

00:09:41.920 --> 00:09:43.522
I'll tell you how!

00:09:43.522 --> 00:09:47.526
Because it was you who made the phony
call, pretending to be Miya-sama!

00:09:47.526 --> 00:09:49.528
I don't know anything about that!!

00:09:49.528 --> 00:09:51.863
It's you that plays dirty!

00:09:51.863 --> 00:09:53.932
That alone disqualifies you!

00:09:54.266 --> 00:09:57.135
And I'd never tolerate
you as a member anyway!

00:10:01.340 --> 00:10:04.209
Well! Let's go, Misonoo-san.

00:10:04.810 --> 00:10:05.944
Ok...

00:10:08.814 --> 00:10:11.416
That's the problem...

00:10:12.217 --> 00:10:16.755
Every year we have our
arrogant lady, Miya-sama,

00:10:16.755 --> 00:10:21.427
...playing her games with
the hearts of the freshmen.

00:10:22.094 --> 00:10:24.296
I don't like this.

00:10:24.963 --> 00:10:26.899
Do you agree?

00:10:29.702 --> 00:10:33.172
Well you don't really
care, do you, Rei?

00:10:42.381 --> 00:10:44.516
Cheer up!

00:10:45.517 --> 00:10:47.920
You were crying yesterday.

00:10:49.455 --> 00:10:52.191
You wanted to join
the Sorority, right?

00:10:53.526 --> 00:10:57.930
Yes, but why me? It
doesn't make sense.

00:10:58.798 --> 00:11:03.936
Never mind all that. You made it!

00:11:05.271 --> 00:11:08.274
I'm so happy! And
we're together, right?

00:11:08.674 --> 00:11:09.809
Yeah...

00:11:11.210 --> 00:11:12.345
Tomoko!

00:11:13.346 --> 00:11:14.814
Tomoko, wait!

00:11:18.484 --> 00:11:19.485
Tomoko...

00:11:20.152 --> 00:11:22.488
So you made it after all...

00:11:22.488 --> 00:11:23.756
Congratulations.

00:11:23.890 --> 00:11:26.759
I didn't see the announcement,
so this is news to me.

00:11:27.360 --> 00:11:28.427
Tomoko...

00:11:29.295 --> 00:11:30.763
You look happy.

00:11:31.430 --> 00:11:35.168
I don't know if I'm happy or not.

00:11:35.368 --> 00:11:38.771
Here's your application
to join the cooking club.

00:11:40.373 --> 00:11:41.774
You wanted to join!

00:11:43.242 --> 00:11:45.645
You'll probably join Flower
Arranging after all...

00:11:45.645 --> 00:11:48.715
Just like the rest of
the Sorority members.

00:11:51.851 --> 00:11:56.856
Tomoko! Being a Sorority member doesn't
mean I can't be your friend!

00:11:57.323 --> 00:11:58.324
Tomoko!

00:12:00.393 --> 00:12:04.397
I'll meet you after school
as usual! Tomoko!

00:12:06.599 --> 00:12:07.801
Tomoko...

00:12:20.147 --> 00:12:25.419
