eastern end, there is a fort.]

00:12:33.893 --> 00:12:38.164
Ok, very good. Be seated.
Miss Misonoo, please...

00:12:39.833 --> 00:12:41.034
Nanako-san!

00:12:41.768 --> 00:12:42.836
Here!

00:12:42.836 --> 00:12:45.372
From the sixth line on,
page twenty seven.

00:12:45.505 --> 00:12:46.773
Yessir!

