00:13:27.347 --> 00:13:28.816
[His chief amusements
were shipping, fishing...]
I can't hear you!

00:13:28.816 --> 00:13:29.483
[His chief amusements
were shipping, fishing...]
<b> </b>

00:13:29.483 --> 00:13:30.618
[...and collecting shells from the shore.]
I can't hear you!

00:13:30.618 --> 00:13:30.952
[...and collecting shells from the shore.]
<b> </b>

00:13:30.952 --> 00:13:32.887
[...and collecting shells from the shore.]
I can't hear you!

00:13:32.887 --> 00:13:35.223
I can't hear you!

00:13:35.823 --> 00:13:37.491
I can't hear you!

00:13:37.825 --> 00:13:39.760
I can't hear you!

00:13:40.027 --> 00:13:41.562
Hey... you... what is...
I can't hear you!

00:13:41.962 --> 00:13:43.564
I can't hear you!

00:13:43.964 --> 00:13:45.432
I can't hear you!

00:13:45.699 --> 00:13:47.501
I can't hear you!

00:13:47.968 --> 00:13:49.503
I can't hear you!

00:13:50.037 --> 00:13:50.571
I can't hear you!

00:13:50.571 --> 00:13:52.306
SHUT THE HELL UP!
I can't hear you!

00:13:56.644 --> 00:13:58.846
Sit next to me if you can't hear!

00:13:58.846 --> 00:14:00.648
I hear her perfectly!

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:09.190
Hurry up! You and you...

00:14:09.190 --> 00:14:12.460
Listen, you! Stop this violence!

00:14:23.204 --> 00:14:25.873
Kaoru-no-Kimi, you're
so marvelous...!

00:14:31.279 --> 00:14:35.016
Don't mix the sugar
and egg white at once.

00:14:35.016 --> 00:14:37.418
That's the key.

00:14:37.418 --> 00:14:41.089
First, you separate the
egg white from the yolk.

00:14:41.089 --> 00:14:42.423
Please begin now.

00:14:51.032 --> 00:14:54.636
Sensei, this is too much
like a circus trick!

00:14:55.103 --> 00:14:58.506
It's easy for girls, but for you...?

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:03.044
It's like you're implying
that I'm not a girl...

00:15:03.044 --> 00:15:06.314
Give me reasons to imply
you ARE a girl, then...

00:15:10.585 --> 00:15:12.654
OK! Whatever it takes!

00:15:17.125 --> 00:15:19.260
I will do the eggs for you...

00:15:27.268 --> 00:15:31.606
The key to resolving them into factors
is to factor the common variables.

00:15:31.606 --> 00:15:33.608
This is a key point.

00:15:33.608 --> 00:15:37.345
For example, X minus
forty-two times...

00:15:41.349 --> 00:15:43.351
I can smell cookies...

00:15:43.952 --> 00:15:46.154
It must be Nanako's
cooking class.

00:15:48.089 --> 00:15:52.627
Tomoko! Being a Sorority member doesn't
mean I can't be your friend!

00:15:53.628 --> 00:15:54.964
Tomoko!

00:15:55.164 --> 00:15:56.365
Tomoko!

00:15:57.899 --> 00:16:02.904
I was wrong. It's not Nanako's fault.

00:16:03.372 --> 00:16:06.708
I'll apologize and make up.

00:16:07.309 --> 00:16:11.847
To squeeze the tube,
start from the end.

00:16:12.247 --> 00:16:15.450
And make sure the cookie sheet is cooled
off before you put it back in the oven.

00:16:17.653 --> 00:16:20.589
You are doing quite well!

00:16:20.589 --> 00:16:22.991
You are really good at this!

00:16:22.991 --> 00:16:25.727
You're being a proper woman.

00:16:25.994 --> 00:16:28.664
But you gave up womanhood!

00:16:28.664 --> 00:16:30.666
You're SO kind!

00:16:31.467 --> 00:16:34.603
Of course, Misonoo-san's
womanhood...

00:16:37.606 --> 00:16:41.410
...should be especially good as far as
cooking and selling is concerned!

00:16:41.610 --> 00:16:42.812
What! Why?

00:16:42.812 --> 00:16:44.346
Her womanhood?

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:46.615
You didn't know?

00:16:46.615 --> 00:16:50.419
Her mother used to work at an
establishment near Jyoto University...

00:16:50.419 --> 00:16:53.088
...as a COCKTAIL WAITRESS!

00:16:53.088 --> 00:16:55.157
Cocktail waitress?
At a bar?

00:16:55.624 --> 00:16:58.093
And at that bar she kept company with
Professor Misonoo...

00:16:58.093 --> 00:17:01.497
...who already had
both a wife and child.

00:17:05.768 --> 00:17:07.837
A wife and a child!?

00:17:08.237 --> 00:17:13.976
And then her mother kicked
out his wife and the child!

00:17:14.176 --> 00:17:15.444
Scandalous!
<b> </b>
<b> </b>

00:17:15.444 --> 00:17:16.645
Scandalous!
Unbelievable!
<b> </b>

00:17:16.645 --> 00:17:19.448
Scandalous!
Unbelievable!
Are there really women like that!

00:17:24.253 --> 00:17:26.656
What the hell!
Pornographer's daughter!!!

00:17:26.656 --> 00:17:28.724
Shut up! You
daughter of a rat dog!

00:17:28.724 --> 00:17:30.593
My father is a lawyer!

00:17:30.593 --> 00:17:31.727
Greedy cheap private detective!
<b> </b>

00:17:31.727 --> 00:17:33.930
Greedy cheap private detective!
How dare you!

00:17:36.666 --> 00:17:37.667
It can't be!

00:17:37.800 --> 00:17:40.336
It can't be true that my
father had a child...!

00:17:44.273 --> 00:17:49.345
Mama and Papa met
after he got divorced...

00:17:49.545 --> 00:17:51.080
That's what my mom said.

00:17:52.148 --> 00:17:55.685
She... she wouldn't lie to me...

00:18:06.429 --> 00:18:10.300
There are times when you have
to endure undeserved slander.

00:18:11.034 --> 00:18:12.769
You don't understand!

00:18:13.303 --> 00:18:17.640
No one truly
understands another...

00:18:17.640 --> 00:18:21.578
...but someone who
cares can try to, anyway.

00:18:42.265 --> 00:18:43.466
Thank you...

00:18:43.600 --> 00:18:44.601
Sign here, please.

00:18:45.802 --> 00:18:48.004
For Nanako...?

00:18:48.471 --> 00:18:50.340
From whom?

00:18:52.275 --> 00:18:53.476
Henmi...?
<b> </b>

00:18:53.476 --> 00:18:55.412
Henmi...?
Henmi Takehiko?

00:18:56.346 --> 00:18:57.547
Oh no...

00:18:57.948 --> 00:18:59.282
How?

00:18:59.549 --> 00:19:00.750
Why?

00:19:13.764 --> 00:19:16.300
I hope Tomoko is waiting for me...

00:19:19.903 --> 00:19:22.639
Misonoo-san? Let's
go home together...

00:19:25.709 --> 00:19:26.977
I'm sorry...

00:19:27.244 --> 00:19:29.246
But Tomoko is waiting for me.

00:19:30.181 --> 00:19:31.248
I see...

00:19:32.783 --> 00:19:34.051
Sorry...

00:19:34.384 --> 00:19:39.456
Tomoko? I saw her walking
toward the music room...

00:19:39.790 --> 00:19:41.525
Really? Thank you!

00:19:59.543 --> 00:20:02.346
You shouldn't bother
waiting for Nanako-san.

00:20:02.479 --> 00:20:03.681
What?

00:20:03.681 --> 00:20:07.084
She won't be able to go
home with you.

00:20:09.954 --> 00:20:13.757
As a member of the Sorority, she
has a lot of socializing to do.

00:20:15.893 --> 00:20:19.296
Keep in mind that she is no longer
an ordinary student.

00:20:22.366 --> 00:20:25.302
She won't be able to go home
together with you from now on.

00:20:26.237 --> 00:20:27.638
From... from now on...?

00:20:28.372 --> 00:20:31.375
She asked me to tell you this.

00:20:32.310 --> 00:20:34.845
I want to hear it from her directly!

00:20:35.112 --> 00:20:36.714
Where is she?

00:20:36.781 --> 00:20:39.917
Being her friend, can't you
understand why she isn't here...?

00:20:39.917 --> 00:20:40.851
So why the hell not?

00:20:43.454 --> 00:20:47.191
Nanako asked me to tell you because
she didn't want to hurt you.

00:20:50.061 --> 00:20:53.598
I'd not be so easily hurt if
she told me herself!

00:21:03.675 --> 00:21:05.476
In that case...

00:21:06.344 --> 00:21:07.412
Tell Nanako good-bye!

00:21:30.969 --> 00:21:34.906
Tomoko didn't wait for me that day.

00:21:35.440 --> 00:21:39.044
Tomoko didn't forgive me..

00:21:39.444 --> 00:21:43.381
I don't want to think about it.

00:21:44.249 --> 00:21:46.785
There is always tomorrow.

00:21:47.719 --> 00:21:52.857
And if not then, the day after...

00:21:52.991 --> 00:21:57.729
We have been friends all this time.

00:22:00.332 --> 00:22:04.669
My brother... my dear brother,

00:22:05.203 --> 00:22:09.141
I have to find out about us.

00:22:09.808 --> 00:22:14.279
And also about my
father, and my mother,

00:22:14.546 --> 00:22:17.482
...and if my father had a child...

00:22:24.156 --> 00:22:26.425
How can Takehiko know her?

00:22:28.293 --> 00:22:29.561
How long...?

00:22:34.433 --> 00:22:35.767
Hi, I'm back.

00:22:36.034 --> 00:22:37.302
Welcome home, dear.

00:22:45.444 --> 00:22:46.512
Ummm... Mom?

00:22:47.312 --> 00:22:48.313
Yes, what?

00:22:54.453 --> 00:22:56.589
I was chosen as a Sorority member!

00:22:56.589 --> 00:22:59.391
Oh, congratulations! How wonderful!

00:23:00.726 --> 00:23:03.195
Here is a package for you.

00:23:42.168 --> 00:23:43.703
Brother!

00:24:09.796 --> 00:24:14.000
I dreamed I was chasing a rainbow...

00:24:14.000 --> 00:24:19.472
Then the rainbow I was chasing was you.

00:24:20.940 --> 00:24:25.078
Before, I had no strength, no will.

00:24:25.078 --> 00:24:30.550
But now because of you, I do.

00:24:31.284 --> 00:24:36.823
Feelings of love, like raindrops

00:24:36.823 --> 00:24:42.296
Come pouring from the sky.

00:24:42.296 --> 00:24:45.032
This is surely a game

00:24:45.032 --> 00:24:47.834
Of some mischievous fairy...

00:24:47.834 --> 00:24:50.236
Always dancing,

00:24:50.236 --> 00:24:55.508
Always capricious...

00:25:03.183 --> 00:25:07.454
Mariko's deception causes Tomoko to
shun Nanako.

00:25:08.255 --> 00:25:15.128
And then, at the Sorority initiation
party, Nanako is shocked by
Miya-sama's actions:

00:25:15.729 --> 00:25:20.133
Miya-sama deliberately drop a kenzan
onto Saint-Juste's hand!

00:25:20.534 --> 00:25:23.937
Next episode:
Thorns of Doubt and Suspicion

00:25:23.937 --> 00:25:25.539
Brother, Dear Brother...
<b> </b>

00:25:25.539 --> 00:25:30.210
Brother, Dear Brother...
There is no end to my tears...
